{
  "id": "628ea7936db60e2d5b0b1dd3",
  "title": "快打旋风3",
  "summary": "这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。 作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、艾迪科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。 这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。 本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。 搓招意义不太…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/057698e191b8d455e7e18ec0e58f5c9b997bfb760a7e8a4ae4add9aff0ccab28cc37deefe95329e6b9baf1b3c8d898db35d8557a16fe0c2f27387f7a0ab1543b50\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a></p>\n<p>这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/bf6c1d8d41618e366837c3271eb187cd4c9e18c9222ae29de0dd9191e7291ec3440374a4d12c5aa52c3c8d4700a4d6546eabb02f681683c7b7ab18ae79603fe85dded7ccd254f3ef27f7ccbb61beed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_043\"></a></p>\n<p>作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》<sup><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d263f66990e407e37e2c33faa4543f62d9dc40fc80ae857999e554be30fc1a9b471a56cb972bf6ad181c88\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[2]</a></sup> 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、<del>艾迪</del>科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/90c5f1ae6399ec2959f9f0976f78ea61fd9330fde6bd92dbc11f88df8ac14a33d27fbb9df28ca8efe77e84bf8b3b5a794c18f56fc59eff7082920e8d2370f55b7dd28380132617c3a96ec88461c9f4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/9fc7c44ccc4fca0a18d3c015530d550a711bf0b1645f8ba820695790bd8987e7a96674269d2f94f664aeab7772905abd5cd3f1bcdfe44e89fc87e501d23086970f1fe362fcf20c80673fa21b7acd52\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_014\"></a></p>\n<p>本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e66cd1799cefa4eb144c2c96c9334c98fd8985091715bd2798b2193c2320b1aacb5b5e126990874faf17d13207523140aa016dec089c26c3b3d2a51573c2d8083791bc62b0dcc3943e3333dcd766c2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_008\"></a></p>\n<p>搓招意义不太大，起码对于女主露西亚是这样。升龙腿收招破绽极大，除了耍帅，就只有落地挨揍的用处。而那个SUPER气槽存在的时间又短，BOSS战时难以抓住时机，也是只能装B用。最实用的还是跑动攻击，手速够的话能把敌人连到死，也挺爽。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/19d40cbc9bb2cda2aeb03e67fdb0b1758e4bfc6f94febaa43e9717088d4d021b219b496abe2215f1f769503c53de8aaf4b8ead6d19a8a9628c44965f8ff7e79b0b5f03f757ae20b28110c6d994fa88\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_003\"></a></p>\n<p>清版动作最重要的还是那说不清道不明的打击感。本作这方面还行，但从出品时间来看，比对面的格斗四人组系列还是稍逊一筹。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1eb2d0561a5e0fcfdd1d60e8a6e04a15618fc12c08e06d93570e5dc3f57a655feb78140440cb8b62c8b457b4ce92f978f8a25e537ba5ba4320f13ed0029c95006d41c7da3503c00c742c578241181f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_028\"></a></p>\n<p>分支路线算特色吗？在1995年这个时间点看来不算，只能算“借鉴”来的。但某些路线可以跳过BOSS，也是挺值得的。有一条不太容易出现的路线是唐人街，场景设计还是挺赞的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/7036d303fd98be7ec33a2c8a6eacb2535412159c424fa433976a5bb2288c57817821f92ab6055f4311e58473ade889b6c9d27a7688876477c931fd22b92eadee8f645538fea35ce975e70c48645c72\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_030\"></a></p>\n<p>只是这一关的BOSS嘛，有点刻板印象了。这只BOSS会点穴嘿！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8f4f360a7acd62d5434dc136c8da7e003c54e80fa8261aa05af83dde68041e7e25c6dcf0ae63b90018715cef94410b4f63a14d8cbdabcfb500ac62f5e1ecdaef549c8dbd2ca36c754fa1d66f7ab0ba\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_063\"></a></p>\n<p>其余的BOSS们。只打一遍可是会认不全的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/752de8fa45892ae03f332c1302c50ada202552fe40b02d0ec0870c98fde1aca8974dcc2d13d05f6ee52b5ab01298884f98de54a6b718d69b3c429f8b7078f7c833a623285093d4a053a52990d164b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_006\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f392b38cd739582d8d18b80d09566672be8af078729ab1b068f2ef124aa65bb34039c15bf193133c8da6cbc0e3ba5adbc55e45fd5c4d0c289edcb19009dee12d100dbbfca123c63bf89dc6c887649b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e9b7030d5e2f8a5fa8306faab0477f5f4b657db282a924419617935a0955537e03f39fe575418dd343515642a9dadd828f0dc6dc08707f201ccbe13412ed1165e5676db5bba7157556aaa4241a92fa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_048\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6819a6457056b234203376819a7056f0024452c014e1d2732936fb056dc13e4744fda46fb45b9ab7c1a9e5e344c426b02329b3173175ab7fc352743bcb2230f594e22e86957045e6c6c9fb9abb68e3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/886651d08485217946f3ee56adfcf680a48a422cb592addec39e03d508976276e543ec419e6f3b1213857ca4e08446632d11871ac45dd5507e0fb48bb7fa71465547a433205e9b5beb818ee84b72a4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_019\"></a></p>\n<p>最终BOSS，只要不被抓住，不难。最后死在电网上，哪怕不是在电网这侧打死的，也会强行漂移过去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/876059eef126bbd29991d672a6519420440d8f81b95115fd89acd9fb354c2a8acb07eb21cbe37ad2bc68aa1cd5530163ec31ebe4638e63ef3c415c4d1756f7626ec6f024051f84aaeeddf36f514e05\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a95a49b998b19011272955ae06ebd05686ec4f8bd0c568d7dededa70b6e7f63a0a410ed4c2e633f9929359eda86b033e96fcb65801c7d0e4ffa6424a764be8d2eaa691db5741bd78ffed2f296d47ea\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_025\"></a></p>\n<p>通关画面，明显男主角金毛的迪恩跟另外三个尿不到一个坑里。迪恩在卡普空后续的其它游戏里再没出现过。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d3bd035d6df6c17ef18afcf46ff51e8f79234de7b56297d154cb0751b760347a9c3b823ea2cccec98389f2312675b986782929234c9f7ceb9615e528a6d8554a8c0299e279d62b34cbd4a2ece39188\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_031\"></a></p>\n<p>选最高难度才能出现真正的结局，也就是“END”这三个字。不值！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/03275b6b908abe78bb6bc58578eb86a22cffc7590a4911cf77d035d6107829042bea164e69167b2ed34ebf45240a4cd48f3cd9b23a4492b42ebb9d9ca514d4d7bd0ec179d035858de851bad2d900de\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/db5c2d6bea8e87578bd89b7a623529b4b15ee478227597020e50c2d7fda62ab9c4b0432f1a999276b86670e3c71ad81dc50d245b1492ed57fd39c12bd05d6c04b220b3cd43e1d18b14bbb0fb2590a7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_032\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(2)</a>：Street Fighter = 陆港街头霸王=台快打旋风，Final Fight = 陆港快打旋风 = 台街头快打</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/final-fight-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/11/darkwing-duck.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">狡猾飞天德</a><span>[53%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/08/ninja-ryuuken-den-tomoe.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者龙剑传：巴</a><span>[51%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/03/tenchi-o-kurau-ii-shokatsu-koumei-den.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">吞食天地2：诸葛孔明传</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2019/05/e-v-o-search-of-enden.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">46亿年物语</a><span>[38%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
